-Yeah, buddy.

1116
01:01:26,187 --> 01:01:27,955
You know, remember from...
from last time, right?

1117
01:01:27,988 --> 01:01:29,356
On the back.
(camera shutter clicking)

1118
01:01:30,024 --> 01:01:31,292
I remember.

1119
01:01:31,325 --> 01:01:32,927
(camera shutter clicking)

1120
