1206
01:06:47,274 --> 01:06:49,243
Do you know what it's like...

1207
01:06:49,276 --> 01:06:51,345
to be where I am now?

1208
01:06:51,646 --> 01:06:54,248
No...you're not real.

1209
01:06:54,916 --> 01:06:57,384
Look what you did to me!

1210
01:06:58,418 --> 01:06:59,621
It's fake.

1211
01:06:59,654 --> 01:07:01,221
(tearing)

1212
01:07:03,992 --> 01:07:06,561
Look what you did to me.

1213
01:07:07,261 --> 01:07:08,930
Don't hide from it!

1214
01:07:09,162 --> 01:07:11,766
No, it's not real.
It's not real.

1215
01:07:12,800 --> 01:07:14,769
You know the truth.

1216
01:07:15,168 --> 01:07:16,938
You should be dead too!

1217
01:07:16,971 --> 01:07:18,573
(dramatic music)
No!

1218
01:07:20,742 --> 01:07:22,142
(door slams)

1219
01:07:23,110 --> 01:07:25,178
(gasping)

1220
01:07:26,915 --> 01:07:28,783
