1221
01:07:32,954 --> 01:07:34,522
Fiona: Orla?

1222
01:07:35,255 --> 01:07:36,591
No.

1223
01:07:36,758 --> 01:07:37,992
You know my voice.

1224
01:07:38,026 --> 01:07:40,460
-Mum, please, no.
-Watch.

1225
01:07:41,563 --> 01:07:43,163
Watch again.

1226
01:07:43,196 --> 01:07:45,165
Watch me burn!

1227
01:07:45,198 --> 01:07:47,200
(flames roaring)

1228
01:07:47,936 --> 01:07:49,336
No!

1229
01:07:51,940 --> 01:07:54,074
(gasping)

1230
01:07:55,910 --> 01:07:57,779
(sobbing)

1231
01:08:05,787 --> 01:08:07,655
-No!
-Ciara: Orla?

1232
01:08:07,689 --> 01:08:08,957
(sobbing)

1233
01:08:08,990 --> 01:08:10,792
Where have you been?

1234
01:08:10,959 --> 01:08:12,794
You're not real.
You're not here.

1235
01:08:12,827 --> 01:08:14,328
You're not real.

1236
01:08:15,763 --> 01:08:18,866
Ciara: It was so dark. I...
I couldn't find you.

1237
01:08:18,900 --> 01:08:22,102
I looked and looked and looked,
but you weren't there.

1238
01:08:22,135 --> 01:08:24,271
No. You're not real.

1239
01:08:26,473 --> 01:08:29,577
I am real.
And I found you.

1240
01:08:29,611 --> 01:08:31,211
(Orla sobbing)

1241
01:08:32,947 --> 01:08:34,849
(mysterious music)

1242
01:08:38,118 --> 01:08:39,654
Ciara?

1243
01:08:40,788 --> 01:08:43,758
I told you I was here.
I told you I was real.

1244
01:08:43,791 --> 01:08:45,693
I finally found you.

1245
01:08:47,294 --> 01:08:49,329
I missed you so bad.

1246
01:08:49,363 --> 01:08:51,933
Oh, my God, I missed you too!

1247
01:08:52,265 --> 01:08:55,369
(sobs) Oh, it's you. It's you.

1248
01:08:55,803 --> 01:08:57,505
Why didn't you come with me?

1249
01:08:57,538 --> 01:08:59,874
You were supposed
to come with me.

1250
01:08:59,907 --> 01:09:01,843
I know. I know I was.

1251
01:09:01,876 --> 01:09:03,978
I didn't ask them to save me.

1252
01:09:04,012 --> 01:09:05,813
We must be together again.

1253
01:09:05,847 --> 01:09:08,049
I'm so sorry.

1254
01:09:08,082 --> 01:09:10,785
Please, Orla. Please bring
us back to you.

1255
01:09:11,085 --> 01:09:13,755
I can't. I don't know how.

1256
01:09:16,289 --> 01:09:18,492
But she said you can.

1257
01:09:19,493 --> 01:09:20,895
(sobs) What?

1258
01:09:20,928 --> 01:09:23,163
She said you can bring us back.

1259
01:09:24,065 --> 01:09:25,533
Who said that?

1260
01:09:25,566 --> 01:09:30,905
The lady. She said she can give
you the powers to bring us back.

1261
01:09:30,938 --> 01:09:32,807
You just have to want it.

1262
01:09:34,075 --> 01:09:35,375
Ciara, I...

1263
01:09:35,409 --> 01:09:37,177
Don't you want us back?

1264
01:09:37,210 --> 01:09:38,946
No, no. Of course I do!

1265
01:09:38,980 --> 01:09:41,015
Then why won't you?

1266
01:09:41,783 --> 01:09:45,452
She knows what you want.
What you've craved.

1267
01:09:45,485 --> 01:09:48,823
She knows you were too afraid.
There's nothing to fear.

1268
01:09:48,856 --> 01:09:52,325
A bond with the Dearg Due
is a death without dying.

1269
01:09:52,359 --> 01:09:53,528
Don't you see?

1270
01:09:53,561 --> 01:09:55,228
You don't have to face
the darkness.

1271
01:09:55,262 --> 01:09:57,098
You'll just be reborn.

1272
01:09:57,131 --> 01:09:58,933
What are you doing?

1273
01:09:59,266 --> 01:10:01,002
You're meant to join with it.

1274
01:10:01,035 --> 01:10:02,369
Let it into you.

1275
01:10:02,402 --> 01:10:05,039
Let it take you and you can
join in its power.

1276
01:10:05,073 --> 01:10:06,941
What? No, I can't!

1277
01:10:06,974 --> 01:10:09,276
-Oh!
-Oh my God...

1278
01:10:09,309 --> 01:10:11,478
(squelching)
Don't...

1279
01:10:11,512 --> 01:10:15,116
Look at me! Look!
It hurts so much!

1280
01:10:15,149 --> 01:10:17,384
Join with the Dearg Due
and use its powers

1281
01:10:17,417 --> 01:10:18,519
to bring me back.

1282
01:10:18,553 --> 01:10:21,421
No! You're not my sister.
I can't...

1283
01:10:21,455 --> 01:10:23,390
It's your fault we died!

1284
01:10:23,423 --> 01:10:25,325
Don't. No, don't, please.

1285
01:10:25,358 --> 01:10:27,829
Joining with the Dearg Due
is the price you have to pay

1286
01:10:27,862 --> 01:10:29,496
for what you did to us!

1287
01:10:29,630 --> 01:10:33,067
No, Ciara, you're not my sister.
You're not my sister...

1288
01:10:33,101 --> 01:10:34,401
Yes, I am!

1289
01:10:34,434 --> 01:10:36,170
No, you're not my sister!

1290
01:10:36,204 --> 01:10:37,839
Look at me!

1291
01:10:37,872 --> 01:10:39,774
(dramatic music)

1292
01:10:40,641 --> 01:10:42,810
My sister...

1293
01:10:42,844 --> 01:10:44,946
My sister was good.

1294
01:10:45,213 --> 01:10:47,414
My sister loved me.

1295
01:10:47,882 --> 01:10:49,617
And my sister would forgive me.

1296
01:10:49,650 --> 01:10:51,552
(sobbing)

1297
01:10:52,553 --> 01:10:55,255
My sister would forgive me.

1298
01:10:56,124 --> 01:10:58,025
(sobbing)

1299
01:11:02,130 --> 01:11:03,798
(dramatic music)

1300
01:11:15,710 --> 01:11:17,578
(gasping)

1301
01:11:19,013 --> 01:11:20,615
Uh! Uh...

1302
01:11:23,684 --> 01:11:25,019
Please...

1303
01:11:25,787 --> 01:11:27,320
(whimpering)

1304
01:11:30,057 --> 01:11:31,959
(snarling)

1305
01:11:38,966 --> 01:11:40,868
(dramatic music intensifies)

1306
01:12:02,056 --> 01:12:03,958
(dramatic music intensifies)

1307
01:12:06,459 --> 01:12:08,563
(hissing)
(screaming)

1308
01:12:09,864 --> 01:12:10,898
(thud)

1309
01:12:27,915 --> 01:12:29,817
(growling)

1310
01:12:41,996 --> 01:12:43,798
(panting)

1311
01:12:46,366 --> 01:12:48,870
(threatening music)

1312
01:12:48,903 --> 01:12:50,304
(footsteps approaching)

1313
01:12:50,338 --> 01:12:51,572
(gasps)

1314
01:12:51,772 --> 01:12:53,373
(snarling)

1315
01:12:58,112 --> 01:12:59,780
(gasping)

1316
01:13:01,282 --> 01:13:03,818
You need me to be
a willing host.

1317
01:13:05,653 --> 01:13:09,190
That's what Sean said, you need
me to be a willing host.

1318
01:13:09,624 --> 01:13:11,458
(grunting)
(growling)

1319
01:13:11,659 --> 01:13:14,629
No, please! No, stop!

1320
01:13:14,662 --> 01:13:17,198
Please, please! (sobbing)

1321
01:13:17,464 --> 01:13:19,100
Stop, please!

1322
01:13:19,133 --> 01:13:20,935
Stop! No!

1323
01:13:20,968 --> 01:13:24,639
No, please. Please stop.
Please. Please.

1324
01:13:24,672 --> 01:13:26,741
(growling)
(sobbing)

1325
01:13:31,012 --> 01:13:33,413
You can't make me...

1326
01:13:36,083 --> 01:13:38,085
(growling)

1327
01:13:38,252 --> 01:13:41,188
No. Please no, no. I don't...

1328
01:13:41,222 --> 01:13:43,557
I don't want it.
I don't want it.

1329
01:13:43,591 --> 01:13:45,626
(sobbing)
(growling)

1330
01:13:48,696 --> 01:13:49,764
Uh!

1331
01:13:56,404 --> 01:13:58,438
You see?

1332
01:13:58,471 --> 01:14:01,309
I'm here. Still me.

1333
01:14:02,143 --> 01:14:05,646
I've always been here.
I didn't go away.

1334
01:14:06,446 --> 01:14:08,683
You'll still be here too.

1335
01:14:09,449 --> 01:14:12,520
And you'll have...everything.

1336
01:14:12,687 --> 01:14:13,854
(suspenseful music)

1337
01:14:13,888 --> 01:14:17,024
Everything lost
will return to you.

1338
01:14:17,490 --> 01:14:20,895
Everything you have
ever dreamed of having...

1339
01:14:21,028 --> 01:14:22,630
will be yours.

1340
01:14:23,463 --> 01:14:25,333
What are you more afraid of?

1341
01:14:25,800 --> 01:14:29,570
Going back to the life
you had before tonight?

1342
01:14:29,603 --> 01:14:33,541
Or embracing the life
that could be?

1343
01:14:34,408 --> 01:14:36,043
My time is done.

1344
01:14:36,644 --> 01:14:39,580
The gift is yours now.

1345
01:14:40,614 --> 01:14:43,017
I am ready for the darkness.

1346
01:14:43,884 --> 01:14:45,519
Are you?

1347
01:14:45,553 --> 01:14:47,588
(sinister music)

1348
01:14:58,199 --> 01:15:00,034
(flames roaring)

1349
01:15:08,576 --> 01:15:10,745
(flames roaring)
(groaning)

1350
01:15:15,449 --> 01:15:16,884
(thud)

1351
01:15:38,105 --> 01:15:40,041
(eerie music)

1352
01:16:02,096 --> 01:16:03,998
(dramatic music)

1353
01:16:24,819 --> 01:16:26,954
(dramatic music intensifies)

1354
01:16:40,401 --> 01:16:41,769
(gasps)

1355
01:16:44,038 --> 01:16:45,773
(birds chirping)

1356
01:16:51,846 --> 01:16:53,280
Ah!

1357
01:16:53,314 --> 01:16:55,116
(gasping)

1358
01:16:56,350 --> 01:16:58,419
Orla? No, no, no, no, no!

1359
01:16:58,452 --> 01:17:01,055
Are you alright? I'm so sorry.

1360
01:17:01,088 --> 01:17:03,224
We should have never brought
you out here like this.

1361
01:17:03,257 --> 01:17:05,192
I'm gonna look after you, okay?

1362
01:17:05,226 --> 01:17:07,495
And whatever you want,
I'll make sure you have it.

1363
01:17:07,529 --> 01:17:09,263
(shallow breathing)

1364
01:17:09,296 --> 01:17:11,165
What's wrong, Orla?

1365
01:17:12,633 --> 01:17:13,834
(vomiting)
Uh!

1366
01:17:13,868 --> 01:17:15,936
Aaaargh!
(hissing)

1367
01:17:16,070 --> 01:17:18,139
(screaming)

1368
01:17:22,611 --> 01:17:24,078
(ripping)

1369
01:17:25,146 --> 01:17:27,047
(dramatic music)

1370
01:17:42,863 --> 01:17:44,965
(dramatic music builds)

1371
01:17:56,377 --> 01:17:58,312
Aaaaargh!

1372
01:18:04,084 --> 01:18:06,053
(sinister music)

1373
01:19:38,613 --> 01:19:40,848
(haunting music)